---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="What we collect and how we use it.">
  <article class="narrow section prose">
    <h1 class="h1">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="note"><strong>Draft.</strong> Have this reviewed before launch, and update it when you choose an email service, analytics, or an ad network.</p>
    <p>When you sign up for The Weekly Bite, suggest a restaurant, or send a business inquiry, we keep what you type in the form (like your email address) so we can reply or send the emails you asked for. We use Kit to store sign-ups and send our emails.</p>
    <p>We never sell your email address. You can unsubscribe from any email with the link at the bottom.</p>
    <p>[Analytics tool, if any, and what it measures.]</p>
    <p>[Ad network, if any, and how it uses cookies.]</p>
    <p>Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
